<title>GERMANY: Schwarz Pharma 9-mo sales jump 22.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Schwarz Pharma 9-mo sales jump 22.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     138.7   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    142.8   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				  885.7   vs 721.7</p>
<p>     domestic sales			    445.6   vs 393.6</p>
<p>     foreign sales			     440.1   vs 328.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Schwarz Pharma AG. The group also said it expects its full year sales to be at 1.18 billion marks up 15 percent from 1995. Its earnings per share, as calculated based on the German DVFA method, is expected to be 4.30 marks, marking a 15 percent rise. The group also proposes raising its dividend by 20 percent to 1.50 marks per share, nominally valued at five</p>
